WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.330
- All right. Welcome back.

00:00:01.330 --> 00:00:03.801
I'm here with Margaret
Cho and Rex Chapman.

00:00:03.801 --> 00:00:04.634
Give it up!

00:00:04.634 --> 00:00:06.447
(audience applause)

00:00:06.447 --> 00:00:09.380
So, Rex is known the king of viral videos.

00:00:09.380 --> 00:00:11.157
So we wanted to play a game we're calling,

00:00:11.157 --> 00:00:12.117
"Wait For It."

00:00:14.226 --> 00:00:16.743
♪ Wait for it ♪

00:00:16.743 --> 00:00:18.630
All right so here's how it works.

00:00:18.630 --> 00:00:21.420
Rex will show us the first
few seconds of a video

00:00:21.420 --> 00:00:23.090
he's recently posted.

00:00:23.090 --> 00:00:25.230
All we have to do is
guess what happens next.

00:00:25.230 --> 00:00:26.500
So, okay.

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:28.110
I'm gonna fail at this. Oh gosh.

00:00:28.110 --> 00:00:28.943
Okay.

00:00:28.943 --> 00:00:30.751
So what should we know about
this first one, you think?

00:00:30.751 --> 00:00:33.540
- Well, I believe this first one is

00:00:33.540 --> 00:00:36.610
a guy just shredding down the slope.

00:00:36.610 --> 00:00:37.443
- [Kelly] Okay.

00:00:37.443 --> 00:00:39.350
- It's like Aspen, could
be anywhere, I guess.

00:00:39.350 --> 00:00:41.990
But he's pretty prolific at it.

00:00:41.990 --> 00:00:42.823
- Okay.

00:00:42.823 --> 00:00:44.630
- And let's watch and
see what happens next.

00:00:44.630 --> 00:00:45.953
- Okay. Okay.

00:00:49.320 --> 00:00:50.153
- Right.

00:00:50.153 --> 00:00:50.986
- I love this sound of that powder.

00:00:50.986 --> 00:00:52.920
- Normally I show videos
with people running

00:00:52.920 --> 00:00:55.370
