bumping into one another.

00:00:55.370 --> 00:00:56.610
What do we think happens here?

00:00:56.610 --> 00:00:57.443
Is it a dog?

00:00:57.443 --> 00:00:58.980
Is it an animal that runs out?

00:00:58.980 --> 00:00:59.925
