00:01:17.260 --> 00:01:18.093
- Okay. Okay.

00:01:18.093 --> 00:01:18.963
Well wait for it.

00:01:18.963 --> 00:01:20.290
Let's see what happens.

00:01:20.290 --> 00:01:21.123
